drm-mali (1.1.0-1) forky; urgency=medium

  * Refactored and hardened for multi-device use.
  * Frame dimensions now captured dynamically from first ADDFB2 call.
  * Fake fb_id base raised to 0x80000000 to avoid collision with real IDs.
  * in_hook made thread-local (__thread) for safety across binder threads.
  * fmap_insert deduplicates on gem handle; tables use LRU eviction.
  * Redundant eglGetDisplay pass-through removed.

